# A1/A1.1/A1_03_numbers_and_personal_info.letz
# Source: Quizlet "A1 Basics Beginner Luxembourgish Lesson 3"
#   https://quizlet.com/_h2t12h
# Slash variants and bracket alternatives split into atomic pairs;
# (m)/(f)/(pl) markers stripped; (formal)/(informal) qualifiers stripped;
# (were) and (boyfriend) bracket alternatives produce extra @en variants.

@lesson A1.03 "Numbers & Personal Info"

# --- Numbers (Quizlet cards 1-11) ---
@word null = zero
@word eent = one
@word zwee = two
@word dräi = three
@word véier = four
@word fënnef = five
@word sechs = six
@word siwen = seven
@word aacht = eight
@word néng = nine
@word zéng = ten

# --- Phrase / vocabulary (Quizlet card 29) ---
@word zesummen = together

# --- Family nouns (Quizlet cards 30-31) ---
@word e Brudder = brother
@word de Brudder = brother
@word Bridder = brothers

@word eng Schwëster = sister
@word d'Schwëster = sister
@word Schwësteren = sisters

# --- Vocabulary from sentences (coverage backfill) ---
@word d'Telefonsnummer = telephone number
@word d'Joer = year
@word de Gebuertsdag = birthday
@word fannen = to find

# --- Sentences (Quizlet cards 12-28, 32-39) ---

@sentence
@lu Wéi ass deng Telefonsnummer?
@en What is your telephone number?
@distractor-en together
@distractor-en zero
@distractor-lu zesummen
@distractor-lu null

@sentence
@lu Wéi ass Är Telefonsnummer?
@en What is your telephone number?
@distractor-en one
@distractor-en two
@distractor-lu eent
@distractor-lu zwee

@sentence
@lu Meng Telefonsnummer ass...
@en My phone number is...
@distractor-en three
@distractor-en four
@distractor-lu dräi
@distractor-lu véier

@sentence
@lu Wou wunnt Dir?
@en Where do you live?
@distractor-en five
@distractor-en six
@distractor-lu fënnef
@distractor-lu sechs

@sentence
@lu Wou wunns du?
@en Where do you live?
@distractor-en seven
@distractor-en eight
@distractor-lu siwen
@distractor-lu aacht

@sentence
@lu Ech wunnen an der Belsch, zu Bréissel.
@en I live in Belgium, in Brussels.
@distractor-en nine
@distractor-en ten
@distractor-lu néng
@distractor-lu zéng

@sentence
@lu Ech wunnen um Kierchbierg.
@en I live in the Kirchberg neighbourhood.
@distractor-en together
@distractor-en zero
@distractor-lu zesummen
@distractor-lu null

@sentence
@lu Wéi vill Joer hutt Dir?
