@distractor-en two
@distractor-lu eent
@distractor-lu zwee

@sentence
@lu Wéi vill Joer hues du?
@en How many years do you have?
@distractor-en three
@distractor-en four
@distractor-lu dräi
@distractor-lu véier

@sentence
@lu Wéini ass Äre Gebuertsdag?
@en When is your birthday?
@distractor-en five
@distractor-en six
@distractor-lu fënnef
@distractor-lu sechs

@sentence
@lu Wéini ass däi Gebuertsdag?
@en When is your birthday?
@distractor-en seven
@distractor-en eight
@distractor-lu siwen
@distractor-lu aacht

@sentence
@lu Wéini sidd Dir gebuer?
@en When were you born?
@distractor-en nine
@distractor-en ten
@distractor-lu néng
@distractor-lu zéng

@sentence
@lu Wéini bass du gebuer?
@en When were you born?
@distractor-en together
@distractor-en zero
@distractor-lu zesummen
@distractor-lu null

@sentence
@lu Mir si bestuet.
@en We are married.
@distractor-en sister
@distractor-en brother
@distractor-lu Schwëster
@distractor-lu Brudder

@sentence
@lu Ech si gescheet.
@en I'm divorced.
@distractor-en together
@distractor-en one
@distractor-lu zesummen
@distractor-lu eent

@sentence
@lu Mir hunn eis getrennt.
@en We separated.
@distractor-en two
@distractor-en three
@distractor-lu zwee
@distractor-lu dräi

@sentence
@lu Ech fannen dech léif.
@en I like you.
@distractor-en four
@distractor-en five
@distractor-lu véier
@distractor-lu fënnef

@sentence
@lu Ech hu Kanner.
@en I have children.
@distractor-en sister
